  "scope": {
    "ja": "共通22実行例の台帳とは別に管理する追加検証集です。配布ZIPを独立展開し、各グループの全固定入力と検査を実行した記録を示します。設定・手法・刻み幅の違いを独立した物理問題の数には加算しません。",
    "en": "These additional validation supplements are managed separately from the common 22-example registry. Receipts cover independent ZIP extraction, tests and every fixed input within each group. Changes of settings, methods or step sizes do not add independent physical problems."
  },
  "execution_navigation": {
    "id": "sa-amg",
    "kind": "supplement",
    "name": {
      "ja": "行列から粗視化するAMG：残差と解誤差を分ける",
      "en": "Matrix-based AMG: distinguish residual and solution error"
    },
    "methods": [
      {
        "id": "amg",
        "name": {
          "ja": "代数的マルチグリッド（AMG）",
          "en": "Algebraic multigrid / AMG"
        },
        "status": "educational-example",
        "url": {
          "ja": "https://hrkoyama.github.io/numerical-methods-atlas/methods/amg/?lang=ja",
          "en": "https://hrkoyama.github.io/numerical-methods-atlas/methods/amg/?lang=en"
        }
      }
    ],
    "formulation": {
      "role": "example-definition",
      "latex": [
        "A_c=P^TAP,\\quad P=(I-\\omega D^{-1}A)T",
        "r_k=b-Ax_k,\\quad \\eta_k=\\|r_k\\|_2/\\|b\\|_2"
      ],
      "note": {
        "ja": "各行の最大非対角係数に対する相対強度からグラフを作り、貪欲な星型集約と余剰節点の隣接集約への付着で暫定補間Tを作ります。P=(I−ωD⁻¹A)T、ω=4/(3ρ̄)、ρ̄はD⁻¹Aの絶対行和上界です。粗演算子はPᵀAP。前後2回のJacobi平滑化と最終小行列の直接解を用います。これは採用した小規模SA変種であり、原著の全構築法や収束定理の再現ではありません。",
        "en": "A graph based on row-relative off-diagonal strength supplies greedy star aggregates; leftover nodes attach to adjacent aggregates. Smooth tentative T via P=(I−ωD⁻¹A)T with ω=4/(3ρ̄), where ρ̄ bounds the absolute row sums of D⁻¹A. Coarse operators are PᵀAP. V-cycles use two pre/post Jacobi sweeps and a terminal dense direct solve. This is a small adopted SA variant, not every construction or convergence theorem in the original paper."
      },
      "url": {
        "ja": "https://hrkoyama.github.io/numerical-methods-atlas/validation/sa-amg/?lang=ja#sa-amg-ja-algorithm",
        "en": "https://hrkoyama.github.io/numerical-methods-atlas/validation/sa-amg/?lang=en#sa-amg-en-algorithm"
      }
    },
